# Only server/ and brands/ go into the image (hosted design 4.10). Everything else, raw RealOEM
# captures in .research-raw/ above all, stays out of every build context, local or remote.
*
!server/
!brands/
server/.venv/
server/tests/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.sqlite3*
**/*.db
**/.env*
